# Compras no cartão e faturas. Exige sessão: rode antes o Login de auth.http.
# O cartão abaixo fecha dia 5 e vence dia 12. POST /transactions numa conta de cartão
# devolve uma transação por parcela; amountCents é o valor TOTAL da compra.

### Preparação: criar o cartão
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa para testes",
  "type": "CreditCard",
  "initialBalanceCents": 0,
  "closingDay": 5,
  "dueDay": 12,
  "creditLimitCents": 1000000
}

> {% client.global.set("cardId", response.body.id); %}

### Compra em 10x (201: 10 parcelas, de abril/2026 a janeiro/2027, vencendo dia 12)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 100005,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10",
  "method": "Credit",
  "description": "Notebook",
  "installments": 10
}

> {%
    client.global.set("purchaseId", response.body[0].installmentPurchaseId);
    client.global.set("installmentId", response.body[1].id);
%}

### Compra à vista no dia do fechamento (entra na fatura de março, vence 12/03)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 4590,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-05",
  "method": "Credit",
  "description": "Padaria"
}

### Faturas do cartão, com o total de cada uma (mais recentes primeiro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cardId}}/statements

### Faturas: guarda a primeira (abril) para editar as datas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cardId}}/statements

> {%
    const byDue = [...response.body].sort((a, b) => a.dueDate.localeCompare(b.dueDate));
    client.global.set("aprilStatementId", byDue[0].id);
%}

### Editar a parcela 2: só descrição e categoria (envie os campos atuais nos demais)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{installmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 10001,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10",
  "method": "Credit",
  "description": "Notebook (parcela 2)"
}

### Erro: mudar o valor de uma parcela isolada (400; o valor muda pela compra inteira)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{installmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 12000,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10",
  "method": "Credit",
  "description": "Notebook"
}

### Editar a compra inteira: novo total e 12 parcelas (redistribui sem perder centavo)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/installment-purchases/{{purchaseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalAmountCents": 120003,
  "installmentCount": 12,
  "description": "Notebook",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10"
}

### Mudar a data da compra: as parcelas vão para as faturas dos ciclos da nova data
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/installment-purchases/{{purchaseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalAmountCents": 120003,
  "installmentCount": 12,
  "description": "Notebook",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-05-10"
}

### Editar as datas da fatura de abril: vencimento adiado para 13/04 (recalcula o caixa)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/statements/{{aprilStatementId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "closingDate": "2026-04-06",
  "dueDate": "2026-04-13"
}

### Erro: vencimento antes do fechamento (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/statements/{{aprilStatementId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "closingDate": "2026-04-13",
  "dueDate": "2026-04-12"
}

### Erro: excluir uma parcela isolada (409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{installmentId}}

### Excluir a compra inteira (204: as 10 parcelas somem; as faturas ficam com total 0)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/installment-purchases/{{purchaseId}}

### Desfazer a exclusão da compra (200: as parcelas voltam; 404 se a compra não estiver excluída)
POST {{baseUrl}}/installment-purchases/{{purchaseId}}/restore

### Erro: 25 parcelas (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 100000,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10",
  "method": "Credit",
  "installments": 25
}

### Erro: menos de 1 centavo por parcela (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 9,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10",
  "method": "Credit",
  "installments": 10
}

### Erro: Pix no cartão (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{cardId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amountCents": 1000,
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-10",
  "method": "Pix"
}
